{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014u6VeAqSMnv3RMp4yHJy11","type":"tool_result","content":"501-    \"Every week a station ranks its 30 most-played new releases and reports them to NACC. WUVT: \\\"they want us to chart our Top 30 on the NACC radio chart every week.\\\" WUSC: the music director \\\"puts it together by looking back at our playlist log to determine the top 30 plays\\\".\",\n502-    \"Then the same chart is published by hand. KWVA retypes it as a list (\\\"1. CLAIRO Album: Charm Label: Virgin\\\"); WUSC posts \\\"Top 30 chart day\\\". One station of the four opened, WDCE, posts it as a picture: \\\"Here's the WDCE Top 30 from 29 July 2026 (click the image to see a larger version)\\\".\",\n503:    \"So the evidence for a hand-made picture is one station; the other three show the weekly chore, not a wish for a graphic. The strings are unbounded: \\\"Brat And It's Completely Different But Also Still Brat\\\" is a real row on KWVA's page.\"\n504-  ],\n505-  \"sources\": [\n506-    \"https://create.richmond.edu/parsons/tag/slippers/\",\n507-    \"https://kwva.uoregon.edu/charts?page=4\",\n508-    \"https://www.wusc.fm/article/2021/08/top-30-chart-08-24-21\",\n509-    \"https://www.wusc.fm/article/2021/11/our-weekly-top-30-chart-11-02-21\",\n510-    \"https://wuvt.vt.edu/article/music-article\",\n511-    \"https://naccchart.com/reporting-guidelines\",\n106:export const ASTRO_DEFAULT_SESSIONS: ReadonlyArray<Readonly<AstroSessionInput>> = [\n853:export const AstroIntegrationSummaryV1 = defineMosaicTemplate<AstroIntegrationSummaryProps>({\n861:  outputHints: {\n871:  propsSchema,","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd122de4-292d-4f08-8c6f-a95cfb1cc2be","uuid":"33e48cd5-ea4c-4c83-a0d4-6a16b3b5b533","timestamp":"2026-10-08T15:05:57.420Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"501-    \"Every week a station ranks its 30 most-played new releases and reports them to NACC. WUVT: \\\"they want us to chart our Top 30 on the NACC radio chart every week.\\\" WUSC: the music director \\\"puts it together by looking back at our playlist log to determine the top 30 plays\\\".\",\n502-    \"Then the same chart is published by hand. KWVA retypes it as a list (\\\"1. CLAIRO Album: Charm Label: Virgin\\\"); WUSC posts \\\"Top 30 chart day\\\". One station of the four opened, WDCE, posts it as a picture: \\\"Here's the WDCE Top 30 from 29 July 2026 (click the image to see a larger version)\\\".\",\n503:    \"So the evidence for a hand-made picture is one station; the other three show the weekly chore, not a wish for a graphic. The strings are unbounded: \\\"Brat And It's Completely Different But Also Still Brat\\\" is a real row on KWVA's page.\"\n504-  ],\n505-  \"sources\": [\n506-    \"https://create.richmond.edu/parsons/tag/slippers/\",\n507-    \"https://kwva.uoregon.edu/charts?page=4\",\n508-    \"https://www.wusc.fm/article/2021/08/top-30-chart-08-24-21\",\n509-    \"https://www.wusc.fm/article/2021/11/our-weekly-top-30-chart-11-02-21\",\n510-    \"https://wuvt.vt.edu/article/music-article\",\n511-    \"https://naccchart.com/reporting-guidelines\",\n106:export const ASTRO_DEFAULT_SESSIONS: ReadonlyArray<Readonly<AstroSessionInput>> = [\n853:export const AstroIntegrationSummaryV1 = defineMosaicTemplate<AstroIntegrationSummaryProps>({\n861:  outputHints: {\n871:  propsSchema,","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014u6VeAqSMnv3RMp4yHJy11","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
